Route10_Interior1_Text_Gentleman::
	.string "A POKéMON CENTER near a cave?\n"
	.string "That’s mighty convenient.$"

Route10_Interior1_Text_Lass::
	.string "When you go outside, you can see\n"
	.string "the roof of a big building.\p"
	.string "That’s the POWER PLANT.$"

Route10_Interior1_Text_Scientist_1::
	.string "The POWER PLANT’s MANAGER is looking\n"
	.string "for a strong POKéMON trainer.\p"
	.string "He needs help getting back\n"
	.string "something that was stolen.$"

Route10_Interior1_Text_Scientist_2::
	.string "I hear TEAM ROCKET got back together\n"
	.string "in JOHTO but fell apart right away.\p"
	.string "I didn’t know anything about that.$"
